{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/924832-wyrd-s-legacies-hub","id":924832,"title":"Wyrd's Legacies Hub","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-02T03:03:03-07:00","id":924832,"title":"Wyrd's Legacies Hub","content":"So I have a big roll of Legacies updates to 2E - both official and my own - and better will be to list them in one topic so they would not got lost in passing months. Enjoy those!<br /> <br /> <b>Official Legacies updates:</b><ul><li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/915818-2e-fan-choir-of-hashmallim\"><b>Choir of Hashmallim 2E</b></a> - Dominions fighting with Abyss by summonig Angels - from <b>Summoners </b>book</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1020276-2e-fan-cult-of-the-doomsday-clock\"><b>Cult of Doomsday Clock 2E</b></a> - Terrorist wanting to end Time and Fallen World - from <b>Legacies: The Sublime</b> book</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/916762-2e-dark-eras-fan-hollow-keepers\"><b>Hollow Keepers 2E</b></a> - Sacred Urns creators that stick souls in them - from <b>Dark Eras</b> book</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/924830-2e-fan-%E2%80%8Breality-stalkers\"><b>Reality Stalkers 2E</b></a> - Mysterium's greatest thieves - from their Order book</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/987669-%E2%80%8B-2e-fan-stone-scribes\"><b>Stone Scribes 2E</b></a> - Mysterium's summoners of peoples past - from <b>Lega</b><b>cies</b>: <b>The Sublime</b></li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/884775-2e-fan-uncrowned-kings\"><b>Uncrowned Kings 2E</b></a> - Silver Ladder and Free Council alchemists that perfect themselves by changing other things - from 1E corebook</li> </ul><b>Created Legacies:</b><ul><li><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074817-2e-children-of-the-stars-aliens-loving-legacy\">Children of the Stars</a></b><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074817-2e-children-of-the-stars-aliens-loving-legacy\"> 2E</a></b>- aliens loving Legacy, that communicates with First Ones across time and space using magic-technology</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/933264-2e-illusionists-of-truth-%E2%80%93-magicians-legacy\"><b>Illusionists of Truth 2E </b></a>- Awakened as stage magicians, split over Silver Ladder and Guardians of Veil</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-19-2017, 03:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T03:24:17-07:00","id":924835,"title":"","content":"Added my Legacies updates done to this day <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"us